# "nuit" after an hour is the night band that crosses midnight: "À deux heures
# de nuit." and "À une heure avancée de la nuit." (CNRTL, "nuit",
# https://www.cnrtl.fr/definition/nuit).  Small hours 1 to 5 stay AM, evening
# hours 6 to 11 are PM, and twelve is midnight (the band split lives in the
# resolver).
nuit
